<https://caselinker.up.railway.app/resource/case/ncmec_2024_1237/admission/1> a cacontology-undercover:IncriminatingStatement ;
    rdfs:label "did not doubt that the sentence Reilly imposed Tuesday was in part affected by the earlier case, and the judge determ..." ;
